[{"answer":"Oh Ben - I just remembered I never filled in that form for Nick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you do it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The course feedback form?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want, we can do it together,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got mine here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that OK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, let's have a look then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What do we have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's fill in the top first,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"let's see, Course, Course code...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, it's Communication in Business.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, Communication... in.. Business.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I do know that, but what's the code?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"CB16 something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"CB162, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm, that's it. Okay and dates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"When did we start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember, my birthday's on May 4th and it was the day after,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"it must have been May 5th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Gosh, doesn't seem that long ago, does it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"No, and we finish at the end of this week, on Friday, so that's...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"July 15th?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Er 16th, Monday was the 12th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, that was the easy bit, now let's have a look -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Please give your comments on the following aspects of the course\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, what's the first one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, course organisation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, clear?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It was, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I think the organisation was clear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, anything else for course organisation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm... It was a good thing he gave us the course outline at the beginning, in the first session,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"that was useful, so I'll put that down, shall I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, going on to suggestions for improvement,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"one thing that wasn't so good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we could have done a bit more work at the beginning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean at the beginning it seemed dead easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it was going to be really easy","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and then all of a sudden in the second half of the course, we got a whole load of work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"reading to do and essays and things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it'd be better if it was more even.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, now course delivery,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"does that mean teaching?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what I thought was really good on this course was the standard of teaching.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually - I mean some of the teachers were better than others -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but the standard generally was fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Much better than other courses I've been on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I agree. Let's put that then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"What about suggestions for improvement?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't think it was all that wonderful when we had great long group discussion sessions that went on for hours and hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't mean we shouldn't have group discussions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"just that they shouldn't go on too long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, on to materials and equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, now what was good about some sessions was the handouts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I thought all the handouts were good actually, and some were great, with website addresses and everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"One problem though with materials was the key texts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"There just weren't enough copies on reserve in the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you can't get the key texts before the session,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"how are you supposed to do the reading?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And not enough computers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to wait ages to get one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, testing and evaluation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't know, it's hard to say until we've got our written assignments back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't talk about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I only got mine in yesterday, it was a real struggle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I hate to think what mark I'll get.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but at least we've done the oral presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that was good, the way I got my feedback really quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And I liked the way we knew what we'd be evaluated on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"we knew the criteria, so we knew we had to think about clarity, organisation, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm not so sure about the written work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing I think is that there's just too much, it's really stressful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, I'd agree","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/80.mp3"},{"answer":"and I don't see why they can't let us know the criteria they use for marking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/81.mp3"},{"answer":"The written assignments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/82.mp3"},{"answer":"But he told us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/83.mp3"},{"answer":"No, for the final exams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/84.mp3"},{"answer":"What are they looking for - what are the criteria?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/85.mp3"},{"answer":"What makes a pass or a fail?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I never thought of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/87.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be really useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, any other comments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought student support was excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/92.mp3"},{"answer":"Other comments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/93.mp3"},{"answer":"No. I can't think of anything else.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/94.mp3"},{"answer":"Nor me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so that's done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/96.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, Ben.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/97.mp3"},{"answer":"No, thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-3-2023-08-08-20-15-42/98.mp3"}]
